\description{
Plot the evolution of diversification rates in relation to trait values
extracted for multiple \code{time_steps} with \code{\link[=run_deepSTRAPP_over_time]{run_deepSTRAPP_over_time()}}.

Rates are averaged across branches at each time step (i.e., \code{focal_time}).
\itemize{
\item For continuous data, branches are grouped by ranges of trait values defined by \code{quantile_ranges}.
\item For categorical data, branches are grouped by trait states.
\item For biogeographic data, branches are grouped by ranges.
}
